<title>SPAIN: SWIMMING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medals table on the sixth</p>
<p>day of the 12-day European swimming championships on Monday:</p>
<p>		   Gold    Silver    Bronze</p>
<p> Russia	   9	  3	   0</p>
<p> Germany	  3	  4	   3</p>
<p> Hungary	  1	  0	   1</p>
<p> France	   0	  4	   -</p>
<p> Italy	    0	  2	   4</p>
<p> Netherlands    0	  0	   1</p>
<p> Spain	    0	  0	   1</p>
<p> Sweden	   0	  0	   1</p>
<p> Ukraine	  0	  1	   1</p>
<p>Note: Two silver medals and no bronze were awarded in the</p>
<p>men's 25-kilometre long-distance race.</p>
</text>
